        <mxCell id="anchor" value="Anchor — &quot;Compliance is a deployment decision, not a runtime check.&quot;&#10;The tier choice happens at provisioning. Runtime isolation enforcement is the consequence, not the design lever." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#f9a825;fontSize=11;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
